      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22749/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place milk and pudding mix in a large bowl; beat with a whisk for 2 minutes. Whisk in condensed milk until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/68ruA8cDtfkUG-TLrEB4r9c-lqQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22749-the-best-banana-pudding-mfs-step-3-340-61a04a6819624a77b8d459fd1cf179bc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22749/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in vanilla, then fold in whipped topping.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dFihhOgD19B_irrEags9H44qizs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22749-the-best-banana-pudding-mfs-step-4-344-987c3dde8c3a4ed89589b62da92adeb4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22749/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange a layer of wafers in the bottom of a glass serving bowl. Top with a layer of banana slices, then a layer of pudding mixture; repeat layers until all ingredients are used.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jAwlQbiu40pTi8xLLK2xplTeMTY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22749-the-best-banana-pudding-mfs-step-5-345-8d02522efa1d4302a95ec9a500910c54.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22749/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "For best results, chill pudding in the refrigerator for at least 1 hour before serving. Top with extra crushed wafers just before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
